Data Content: BF D5 AF E2 D5 D3 4C 58 62 7D DD D9 DF DE 47 B2 D7 D9 CD 78 77 36 E2 E6 49 F0 DC 86 86 F2 F0 09
# Block Security Status: 01 = locked, 00 = not locked
